  "readableHtml": "\n<div><p class=\"source-reference\">嵌入资源：<a href=\"http://www.wanmei.com/top/topw2i.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">http://www.wanmei.com/top/topw2i.htm</a></p></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n    <div>\n                <div></div>\n                <div><a href=\"https://w2i.wanmei.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"assets/57b9674c5c01d917be6e.gif\" alt=\"完美国际\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div>\n    \t<img src=\"assets/0bce2fe6a932385c58fb.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        \t<a href=\"https://w2i.wanmei.com/main.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"assets/28a82858dc7cd9f465cb.gif\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"http://passport.wanmei.com/jsp/member/register.jsp\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"assets/28a82858dc7cd9f465cb.gif\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://w2i.wanmei.com/download/client/index.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"assets/28a82858dc7cd9f465cb.gif\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"http://pay.wanmei.com/e/epage/setup_2_wanmei2.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"assets/28a82858dc7cd9f465cb.gif\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"http://bbs.w2i.wanmei.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"assets/28a82858dc7cd9f465cb.gif\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\t\n\n    </div>\n    <div>\n    \t<img src=\"assets/2a25d6aef057604b7df5.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\">\n     \t<img src=\"assets/7eca6700ab4096d269a4.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    \t<img src=\"assets/a9fe6690a68ffe0b0845.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    \t<img src=\"assets/f909a3dc6e734dfbdc54.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    \n    <div>\n    \t<img src=\"assets/68c77d38d4a1284b4ac1.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    \n    <div>\n    \t<div>\n            <div>\n            <div>\n            <div>\n                <div>\n                    <img src=\"assets/fc492e321e2197e54d91.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                      <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"#page=9a0413ce0568e20f31a3\">如何进行装备精练？</a></li>\n                    \t<li><a href=\"#page=02e5d3da43fb43417c6a\">精练辅助道具都有什么？</a></li>\n                    \t<li><a href=\"#page=6dfa9feea78ce5fc8134\">怎样获得高级龙珠？</a></li>\n                    \t<li><a href=\"#page=a0d736b1f895c8a9ac74\">如何给装备进行打孔？</a></li>\n                    \t<li><a href=\"#page=7423dd05d3a0993cf2d1\">怎么用天人合一符绑定装备？</a></li>\n                    \t<li><a href=\"#page=79d7a9f0b0425180fdfd\">如何进行装备精练转移？</a></li>\n                    \t<li><a href=\"#page=8dc6c6b7c0e7ba9af483\">如何给装备镶嵌魂石？</a></li>\n                    \t<li><a href=\"#page=a70f75ea8408096665b5\">怎么获得高级魂石？</a></li>\n                    \t\n\n                    </ul>\n                    <div></div>\n                    <dl>\n                    <dt><a href=\"#page=6ef60683af49b980d73c\"><img src=\"assets/8232fb87f7bf54fafce3.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></dt>\n                    <dt><a href=\"#page=ddb9fc3f70957c28e9b5\"><img src=\"assets/7970e7d6beb0e016b666.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></dt>\n                    <dt><a href=\"#page=a617111463f23ad7d400\"><img src=\"assets/7d9390847630567c4122.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></dt>\n                    <dt><a href=\"#page=98f433995184914eec55\"><img src=\"assets/94315e8fa52c660fa97b.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></dt>\n                    </dl>\n                </div>\n             </div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n        \t\n            <div>\n            <div>\n            <div>\n<p><span>如何给装备进行打孔？</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>　　玩家可以使用天工符文在各城的“完美商城专员”处进行装备打孔，武器最多可打2孔，防具最多4孔。</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>　　注：天工符文可在乾坤袋中购得，将要进行打孔的装备放上且背包内有足够数量的天工符文时即可完成装备打孔。</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://w2i.wanmei.com/hd/wi_itemsdemo/images/pic/faq04_01.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"assets/128f3ed6dfdb8d25a465.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><p class=\"source-reference\">嵌入资源：<a href=\"http://www.wanmei.com/top/down.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">http://www.wanmei.com/top/down.htm</a></p></div>\n\n<div>\n \n\n</div>\n",
